I can't remember the last time I had two containers on one space.  I'm sure 
there have been many games where I have unlocked/looted containers 300+ times 
and never had two on the same square.

The proper solution is to ditch the confirmation prompt and have a special 
case prompt for multiple containers.

Unlock what?

Tools
a - a chest
b - a large box
c - a chest
(end)

>  Also, unlocking a lockable container is not a zero-risk operation
> (even beyond the matter of its time cost) unless I'm misremembering the
